   "lines": [
    "All the fellows",
    "greeted me with",
    "enthusiasm. To",
    "my great sur-",
    "prise I was offered",
    "the Porcellian; of",
    "course I could not",
    "accept, being a",
    "member of the",
    "A.D - but I wish",
    "I could. It is very",
    "pleasant to get back",
    "among all the",
    "fellows again; but",
    "I can't help feeling",
    "a little bit home",
    "sick."
   ],
